  * CLI: restore anchored selector denies beside a placeholder
    (#16469). Since #15942 the console's canonical-forms walk ate
    the keyword after `show route`'s `<destination>` placeholder
    as its value, so anchored `deny-commands "^show route table$"`
    / `"^show route protocol$"` / `"^show route instance$"` no
    longer denied `show route table <name>` (and siblings) on the
