    make_config_drive and sign, and the `os.execvp` re-exec, are named
    unreached in the new seam test's reach map, which an AST census
    re-derives so the enumeration cannot drift silently.
  * Cluster: extract the generation-guard and peer-snapshot domains of
    SessionSync into value sub-structs (sessionGenState / peerSnapshotState,
    #16159). Storage only — every method keeps its name and signature, the
    #9915 genGuard* cap counters keep their names, and a lock-order graph
