  * Build: add a decoupled advisory tooling CI leg (#16197).
    `make tooling-check` (`scripts/ci_tooling_check.sh`, `test.yml`
    job `tooling`) runs pinned shellcheck v0.11.0 over an explicit
    bounded file list and the hermetic Python subset under `scripts/`
