    per leg (also to $GITHUB_STEP_SUMMARY). `ran==0`, a missing
    covered file, a zero-test Python file, or any skip deviating
    from the explicit `expected_skipped=0` policy is red, so an
    empty or all-skip leg never paints green. Advisory per
    `docs/ci-gate-contract.md` -- not a merge gate without a
    recorded baseline-green period. `scripts/ci-tooling-check-
    selftest.sh` (in `make selftest`) proves the seeded-failure,
    `ran==0` and unexpected-skip reds hermetically. Also add the
